  "id": "cap-0066/restore-footprint-insufficient-refundable-fee",
  "title": "RestoreFootprint whose refundable fee cannot pay the restore's rent fails with INSUFFICIENT_REFUNDABLE_FEE",
  "kind": "ledger",
