  ],
  "why": "The resource fee of 4000 covers the non-refundable part, so the transaction is admitted, but what is left for refundable charges is less than the rent the restore costs. The operation fails while applying; readers that compute fees from the declared resource fee or expect a refund misreport what E paid.",
